# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Glarb permits casting the eligible top spell and playing the next top land.
# Forcing: The hand is empty and both cards begin in the library.
# AI behavior: An empty hand and battlefield provide no response decisions.
# Failure modes: A missing action blocks the flow; a missing permanent disproves resolution.
# Card roles: Glarb grants permission; Baloth has mana value four; Mountain is the next top.
# Protocol path: Legal actions, mana payment, resolution, and land play.
